# makepkg build artifacts
/src/
/pkg/
*.pkg.tar.*
*.tar.xz
*.tar.xz.sig
*.tar.gz
*.tar.zst

# Patch files in this directory are, by default, upstream cherry-picks that
# makepkg downloads from the source=() URLs (hash-named, re-fetched on every
# build, not authored here). Listing them individually meant every new
# backport leaked into `git status` until someone noticed, so ignore the whole
# class and explicitly un-ignore the patches we actually own.
#
# Adding a new local overlay patch? Add a !-line for it here as well as to
# PKGBUILD's source=() and sha256sums+=().
*.patch
!overlay.patch
!screen-edge-corners.patch
!swap-gesture-fingers.patch
!virtual-desktops-debug.patch
!virtual-desktops-fix.patch
